<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/vulnerabilityDisclosureReport> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A reference to a Vulnerability Disclosure Report (VDR) which provides the software supplier's analysis and findings describing the impact (or lack of impact) that reported vulnerabilities have on packages or products in the supplier's SBOM as defined in [NIST SP 800-161 Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management Practices for Systems and Organizations](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/161/r1/final)."@en .
